    <summary>Advanced Windows Optimization, Debloating, and Performance Suite CLI</summary>
    <description>
WinAurex is an advanced Windows optimization, debloating, and performance suite with a unified CLI.

### Features
- **status**: Live hardware and diagnostic report
- **optimize**: Apply safe or full batch and registry optimizations
- **clean**: Purge temp files, system caches, and update residue
- **profile**: Switch between Max Performance, Balanced, and Enterprise tuning profiles
- **repair**: Automated SFC, DISM, network, audio, and Windows update repairs
- **bench**: Run built-in system benchmark and generate HTML health diagnostics
    </description>
